002	EXO	020	001	God spoke all the following words:
002	EXO	020	002	“I am the Lord your God, who led you out of Egypt, out of the land of your slavery.
002	EXO	020	003	You must not have any other gods except me.
002	EXO	020	004	You must not make for yourself any kind of idol, whether in the form of anything in the heavens above, or on the earth beneath, or in the waters below.
002	EXO	020	005	You must not bow down before them or worship them; for I am the Lord your God and I am passionately exclusive. I lay the consequences of the sin of those who hate me on their sons, grandsons, and great-grandsons;
002	EXO	020	006	but I show trustworthy love to the thousands of generations who love me and keep my commandments.
002	EXO	020	007	You must not use the name of the Lord your God in a wrong way, for the Lord will not forgive anyone who uses his name in a wrong way.
002	EXO	020	008	Remember the Sabbath day to keep it holy.
002	EXO	020	009	You have six days to work and earn your living,
002	EXO	020	010	but the seventh day is the Sabbath to honor the Lord your God. On this day you must not do any work—not you, not your son or daughter, not your male slave or female slave or livestock, and not the foreigner who is staying with you.
002	EXO	020	011	For the Lord made the heavens and the earth, the sea, and everything in them in six days, and then rested on the seventh day. That's why the Lord blessed the Sabbath day and made it holy.
002	EXO	020	012	Honor your father and mother, so that you may live a long time in the land that the Lord your God is giving you.
002	EXO	020	013	You must not murder.
002	EXO	020	014	You must not commit adultery.
002	EXO	020	015	You must not steal.
002	EXO	020	016	You must not give false evidence against others.
002	EXO	020	017	You must not desire to have anyone else's house. You must not desire to have their wife, or their male slave or female slave, or their ox or donkey, or anything else that belongs to them.”
002	EXO	020	018	When all the people heard the thunder and the sound of the trumpet, and saw the lightning and the smoke from the mountain, they trembled with fear and stood a long way off.
002	EXO	020	019	“You speak to us, and we'll listen,” they said to Moses. “But don't let God speak to us, or we'll die.”
002	EXO	020	020	Moses told them, “Do not be afraid, for God has only come to test you. He wants you to be in awe of him so that you don't sin.”
