003	LEV	017	015	Anyone, Israelite or foreigner, who eats anything found dead or killed by wild animals must wash their clothes and wash with water, and they will be unclean until the evening. Then they will be clean.
003	LEV	017	016	But if they don't wash their clothes and wash themselves with water, then they bear responsibility for their guilt.”
003	LEV	018	001	The Lord told Moses,
003	LEV	018	002	“Tell the Israelites: I am the Lord your God.
