003	LEV	018	007	Don't shame your father by having sex with your mother. She is your mother; don't have sex with her.
003	LEV	018	008	Don't have sex with any of your father's wives and shame your father.
003	LEV	018	009	Don't have sex with your sister, whether she's your father's daughter or your mother's daughter, or whether she was born in the same house as you or somewhere else.
003	LEV	018	010	Don't have sex with your granddaughter, your son's daughter or your daughter's daughter, because that would be a shameful thing for you.
003	LEV	018	011	Don't have sex with the daughter of any of your father's wives or the daughter of your father. She is your sister.
003	LEV	018	012	Don't have sex with your father's sister. She is a close relative of your father.
003	LEV	018	013	Don't have sex with your mother's sister. She is a close relative of your mother.
