003	LEV	018	019	Don't have sex with a woman during the time she is unclean because of her period.
003	LEV	018	020	Don't commit any sex act with any other man's wife. This would pollute you and make you unclean.
003	LEV	018	021	Don't give any of your children as a human sacrifice to Molech, for you must not disgrace the character of your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	018	022	Don't have sex with a man as with a woman. That is something disgusting.
