003	LEV	018	027	The people who lived in the land before you practiced all these disgusting things, and the land became polluted.
003	LEV	018	028	If you pollute the land, it will vomit you out just like it did the nations before you.
003	LEV	018	029	Consequently anyone who does any of these disgusting things must be expelled from their people.
003	LEV	018	030	You must accept my demand that you don't follow any of these disgusting practices done before you arrived. Don't pollute yourselves and make yourselves unclean. I am the Lord your God.”
003	LEV	019	001	The Lord told Moses,
003	LEV	019	002	“Tell all the Israelites: You must be holy because I am holy; I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	003	Show respect for your mother and father, and keep my Sabbaths. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	004	Don't turn to idols for help or make metal images of gods. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	005	When you sacrifice a peace offering to the Lord, make sure you do it correctly so God will accept you.
003	LEV	019	006	It needs to be eaten the day you sacrifice it, or the next day. Whatever is left over on the third day must be burned.
003	LEV	019	007	If you do eat some of it on the third day, the sacrifice becomes repulsive and won't be accepted.
003	LEV	019	008	Anyone who eats it will bear responsibility for their guilt, for they have made unclean what is holy to the Lord. They must be expelled from their people.
003	LEV	019	009	When you harvest the crops grown on your land, don't harvest right up to the edges of your field, or collect what has been missed.
003	LEV	019	010	Don't take every last grape from your vineyard or pick up the ones that have fallen. Leave them for the poor people and foreigners. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	011	Don't steal. Don't lie. Don't deceive each other.
003	LEV	019	012	Don't swear oaths in my name that are not true, otherwise you defame the character of your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	013	Don't cheat others or rob them. Don't refuse to pay wages due to workers until the morning.
003	LEV	019	014	Don't speak badly about deaf people. Don't put objects in the way of blind people to trip them up. Instead show respect to your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	015	Don't be a corrupt judge. Don't show favoritism to the poor or to the rich. Judge others fairly.
003	LEV	019	016	Don't go around spreading false rumors about people. Don't keep quiet when the lives of others are at risk. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	017	Don't hold onto hateful feelings towards others. Talk honestly with your neighbors, so that you don't sin because of them.
003	LEV	019	018	Don't look for revenge or hold a grudge against anybody, but love your neighbor as yourself. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	019	Do what I tell you! Don't make different kinds of livestock breed together. Don't sow your fields with two different kinds of seed. Don't wear clothes made of two different kinds of material.
003	LEV	019	020	If a man has sex with a servant girl promised to become another man's wife, but who hasn't yet been bought or set free, then compensation has to be paid. However, they are not to be killed, because she hadn't been set free.
003	LEV	019	021	But the man must bring a ram as his guilt offering to the Lord at the entrance of the Tent of Meeting.
003	LEV	019	022	The priest will set things right for him before the Lord using the ram of the guilt offering for the sin he has committed, and his sin will be forgiven.
003	LEV	019	023	When you enter the land and plant any kind of fruit tree, treat the fruit at first as unclean. For three years you are forbidden to eat it.
003	LEV	019	024	The fourth year all the fruit must be dedicated to the Lord as a praise offering.
003	LEV	019	025	However, the fifth year you may eat the fruit and in this way you will have an even greater harvest. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	026	Don't eat meat with blood in it. Don't use fortune-telling or witchcraft.
003	LEV	019	027	Don't cut your hair on the sides of your head or trim the sides of your beard,
003	LEV	019	028	don't cut your bodies in some pagan ritual for the dead, and don't get yourselves tattoos. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	029	Don't bring shame on your daughter by making her a prostitute, otherwise the land will become morally and spiritually depraved.
003	LEV	019	030	Keep my Sabbaths and show respect for my sanctuary. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	031	Don't try and find help from mediums or spiritists—don't even go looking for them, otherwise they will corrupt you. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	032	Stand up and be respectful of older people. Show reverence for your God. I am the Lord.
003	LEV	019	033	Don't mistreat foreigners who live in your country.
003	LEV	019	034	Treat them in the same way as a fellow citizen, and love them as you love yourself, because you were once foreigners living in Egypt. I am the Lord your God.
003	LEV	019	035	Don't use dishonest weights and measures.
003	LEV	019	036	Make sure your scales and weights are accurate, that your measures of ephah and hin are correct. I am the Lord your God who led you out of Egypt.
003	LEV	019	037	Keep all my rules and regulations, and make sure you follow them. I am the Lord.”
003	LEV	020	001	The Lord told Moses,
