004	NUM	002	013	and he has 59,300 men.
004	NUM	002	014	Next is the tribe of Gad. Their leader is Eliasaph, son of Deuel,
004	NUM	002	015	and he has 45,650 men.
004	NUM	002	016	So the total number of men in the area of the camp of Reuben is 151,450. They shall march out in second place.
004	NUM	002	017	The Tent of Meeting which stands at the center of the camp is to accompany the Levites. They are to march out in the same order as they set up camp, each in their rightful place under their flag.
004	NUM	002	018	The tribal division of Ephraim is to camp under their flag on the west side. Their leader is Elishama, son of Ammihud,
004	NUM	002	019	and he has 40,500 men.
