004	NUM	002	028	and he has 41,500 men.
004	NUM	002	029	Next is the tribe of Naphtali. Their leader is Ahira son of Enan,
004	NUM	002	030	and he has 53,400 men.
004	NUM	002	031	So the total number of men in the area of the camp of Dan is 157,600; They shall march out last, with their flags.”
