005	DEU	003	001	We set off and went up the road towards Bashan. Og, king of Bashan, and his whole army came out to fight us at Edrei.
005	DEU	003	002	But the Lord told me, “Don't be afraid of him, for I have handed him over to you, together with all his people and his land. Deal with him as you did with Sihon, king of the Amorites, who ruled in Heshbon.”
