005	DEU	004	022	So I will not be crossing the Jordan, because I have to die here in this land. But you will cross over and occupy that good land.
005	DEU	004	023	However, be careful not to forget the agreement of the Lord your God that he made with you. Don't make an idol for yourselves in the form of anything, because he has forbidden you to do this.
005	DEU	004	024	For the Lord your God is a fire that burns everything up. He is an exclusive God.
005	DEU	004	025	After you have been living in the country for a long time and have had children and grandchildren, you may then spoil the relationship you have with the Lord and make an idol in some form. The Lord your God sees this as evil and it makes him angry.
