005	DEU	004	031	The Lord your God is a merciful God. He won't abandon you or destroy you or forget the agreement he made with your forefathers, confirmed by a solemn promise.
005	DEU	004	032	Think about it! Examine the whole of history from the beginning of time, long before you existed, when God made human beings, right up until now. Ask this question anywhere, from one end of the earth to the other: Has anything as amazing as this ever happened before; has anyone ever heard anything like this?
005	DEU	004	033	Has a people ever heard the voice of God speaking out of the fire, like you have, and survived?
