005	DEU	028	017	You will be cursed by not having bread.
005	DEU	028	018	You will be cursed by not having children, and by not having good harvests, and by your cattle not having calves, and your sheep not having lambs.
005	DEU	028	019	You will be cursed wherever you go and in everything you do.
