005	DEU	028	023	The sky above you will be like bronze, and the earth beneath you will be like iron.
005	DEU	028	024	The Lord will change the rain of your land into dust and sand; it will fall from the sky on you until you're destroyed.
005	DEU	028	025	The Lord will have your enemies defeat you. You will attack them from one direction, but you will scatter seven different ways. Everyone on earth will be horrified at what happens to you.
