006	JOS	024	016	The people responded, “We are never going to give up on the Lord and worship other gods!
006	JOS	024	017	For the Lord our God brought us and our forefathers out of slavery in Egypt. He was the one who did great miracles before our very eyes. He looked after us on the way as we traveled through the lands of many nations.
006	JOS	024	018	The Lord drove out before us the Amorites and all the other nations who were living in the land. So we will worship the Lord, for he is our God!”
006	JOS	024	019	Joshua told the people, “Remember that the Lord is a holy and jealous God. You won't be able to worship him, and he won't forgive your rebellion and sins
006	JOS	024	020	if you give up on him and worship foreign gods. He will turn against you and destroy you despite all the good he has done for you.”
006	JOS	024	021	“Don't say that!” the people replied. “We will worship the Lord!”
