007	JDG	019	025	But the men refused to listen, so the man grabbed his concubine and threw her outside to them. They raped her and abused her all night until the morning, and only discarded her at dawn.
007	JDG	019	026	As night turned into day she returned to the house where her master was staying and collapsed in front of the door as it got light.
007	JDG	019	027	Her master got up in the morning and opened the door of the house. He went out to continue his journey and there was his concubine, stretched out in the doorway of the house, with her hands holding onto the doorstep.
