007	JDG	020	023	The Israelites went and cried before the Lord until the evening and asked, “Should we go and attack the Benjamites again, our relatives?” “Go and attack them,” the Lord replied.
007	JDG	020	024	So the second day they advanced to attack the army of Benjamin.
007	JDG	020	025	However, Benjamites came out of Gibeah once more and slaughtered eighteen thousand Israelites, all armed with swords.
