009	1SA	031	008	The next day, when the Philistines went to strip the dead, they found Saul and his three sons lying on Mount Gilboa.
009	1SA	031	009	They cut off Saul's head, stripped him of his armor, and sent messengers throughout the country of the Philistines to announce the news in the temples of their idols and to their people.
009	1SA	031	010	They placed his armor in the temple of the Ashtoreths, and nailed his body to the town wall of Beth-shan.
