010	2SA	022	001	David sang the words of this song to the Lord on the day when the Lord saved him from all his enemies, and from Saul.
010	2SA	022	002	He sang: “The Lord is my rock, my fortress, and my Savior.
010	2SA	022	003	He is my God, my rock who protects me. He shields me from harm, his power saves me, he keeps me safe. He is my protector; he is my savior; he saves me from violence.
010	2SA	022	004	I call for help from the Lord, who should be praised, and he saves me from those who hate me.
