010	2SA	022	014	The Lord thundered from heaven; the voice of the Most High resounded.
010	2SA	022	015	He fired his arrows, scattering his enemies, he routed them with his lightning bolts.
010	2SA	022	016	The Lord roared, and by the wind from the breath of his nostrils the valleys of the sea could be seen and the foundations of the earth were uncovered.
