010	2SA	022	020	He set me free, he rescued me because he's happy with me.
010	2SA	022	021	The Lord rewarded me because I do what's right; he repaid me because I am innocent.
010	2SA	022	022	For I have followed the Lord's ways; I have not sinned by turning away from my God.
010	2SA	022	023	I have kept all his laws in mind; I have not ignored his commandments.
010	2SA	022	024	I am blameless in his sight; I keep myself from sinning.
010	2SA	022	025	The Lord rewarded me for doing what's right. I am innocent in his sight.
010	2SA	022	026	You show trust to those who are trusting; you show integrity to those with integrity,
010	2SA	022	027	You show yourself pure to those who are pure, but you show yourself astute to those who are crafty.
010	2SA	022	028	You save the humble, but your eyes watch the proud to bring them down.
010	2SA	022	029	You, Lord, are my lamp. The Lord lights up my darkness.
010	2SA	022	030	With you, I can charge down a troop of soldiers; with you, my God, I can climb a fortress wall.
