010	2SA	022	047	The Lord lives! Blessed be my Rock! May the God who saves me be praised!
010	2SA	022	048	God avenges me, he puts peoples under me,
010	2SA	022	049	He frees me from those who hate me. You keep me safe from those who rebel against me, you save me from violent men.
