011	1KI	008	055	Solomon stood, and in a loud voice he blessed the whole assembly of Israel, saying,
011	1KI	008	056	“Praise the Lord, who has given rest to his people Israel in accordance with everything he promised. Not a single word has failed among all the good promises he made through his servant Moses.
011	1KI	008	057	May the Lord our God be with us in the same way he was with our forefathers. May he never leave us or abandon us.
