011	1KI	013	016	“I can't turn around and go with you, and I won't eat or drink with you in this place,” the man of God replied.
011	1KI	013	017	“The Lord ordered me, saying ‘You must not eat or drink anything there, or return by the way you came.’”
011	1KI	013	018	But the old prophet told him, “I am also a prophet, just like you. An angel told me God said, ‘Take him home with you so that he can have something to eat and drink’” But he was lying to him.
