011	1KI	013	020	As they were sitting at the table, a message from the Lord came to the prophet who had brought him back.
011	1KI	013	021	He called out to the man of God who had come from Judah, “This is what the Lord says: Because you have disobeyed the word of the Lord and have not followed the orders that the Lord your God gave you,
011	1KI	013	022	instead you went back and ate and drank in the place where he told you not to, your body will not be buried in the tomb of your fathers.”
