011	1KI	014	015	The Lord will strike Israel like a reed jerked to and fro by the water. He will pull up Israel by the roots from this good land that he gave their forefathers and scatter them beyond the Euphrates, because they have made their pagan Asherah poles, making the Lord angry.
011	1KI	014	016	He will abandon Israel because of the sins of Jeroboam, those that he committed himself, and those he made Israel commit.”
