011	1KI	014	024	There were even cult prostitutes in the land. They followed all the disgusting practices of the nations that the Lord had driven out before the Israelites.
011	1KI	014	025	In the fifth year of King Rehoboam's reign, Shishak, king of Egypt, attacked Jerusalem.
011	1KI	014	026	He took the treasures of the Lord's Temple and the royal palace. He took everything, including all the gold shields Solomon had made.
