012	2KI	013	009	Jehoahaz died and was buried in Samaria. His son Jehoash succeeded him as king.
012	2KI	013	010	Jehoash, son of Jehoahaz, became king of Israel in Samaria in the thirty-seventh year of the reign of King Joash of Judah, and he reigned for sixteen years.
012	2KI	013	011	He did what was evil in the Lord's sight and did not end all the sins that Jeroboam, son of Nebat, had made Israel commit—he continued to follow them.
