012	2KI	020	008	Hezekiah had previously asked Isaiah, “What is the sign to confirm that the Lord is going heal me and that I will go to the Lord's Temple in three days time?”
012	2KI	020	009	Isaiah replied, “This is the sign from the Lord to you that the Lord will do what he promised: Do you want the shadow to go forward ten steps, or back ten steps?”
012	2KI	020	010	“It's easy enough for the shadow to go forward ten steps, but not to go back ten steps,” Hezekiah answered.
012	2KI	020	011	So Isaiah the prophet asked the Lord, and he moved the shadow back the ten steps it had gone down on the stairway of Ahaz.
