014	2CH	028	003	He burned sacrifices in the Valley of Ben-hinnom, and sacrificed his children in the fire, following the disgusting practices of the peoples the Lord had driven out before the Israelites.
014	2CH	028	004	He presented sacrifices and burned incense offerings on the high places, on the mountain tops, and under every living tree.
