014	2CH	029	010	But now I'm going to make an agreement with the Lord, the God of Israel, so that his fierce anger will no longer fall on us.
014	2CH	029	011	My sons, don't neglect your responsibilities, for the Lord has chosen you to stand in his presence to serve him, and to be his ministers presenting burnt offerings.”
