015	EZR	008	027	20 gold bowls worth 1,000 darics, and two articles of highly-polished bronze, as valuable as gold.
015	EZR	008	028	I told them, “You are set apart for the Lord, and these Temple items are too. The silver and gold are a voluntary offering to the Lord, the God of your forefathers.
