018	JOB	018	011	Terrors scare the wicked, coming at them from every side, chasing them, biting at their heels.
018	JOB	018	012	Hunger robs them of strength; disaster waits for them when they fall.
018	JOB	018	013	Disease devours their skin; deadly disease consumes their limbs.
018	JOB	018	014	They are torn from the homes they trusted in and taken to the king of terrors.
