018	JOB	020	007	they will vanish forever like their own excrement. People who knew them will ask, ‘Where have they gone?’
018	JOB	020	008	They will vanish like a dream, never to be found, fleeing like a vision of the night.
018	JOB	020	009	Those who once saw them will not see them anymore; their families will never set eyes on them again.
018	JOB	020	010	Their children will have to pay back the poor; they will have to return their wealth.
018	JOB	020	011	Though the wicked have bodies that are young and strong, they will die and be buried.
