018	JOB	020	013	not letting it go but keeping it in their mouths,
018	JOB	020	014	in their stomachs it turns bitter, becoming like snake venom inside them.
018	JOB	020	015	They swallow wealth and vomit it up again; God forces it from their stomachs.
018	JOB	020	016	They suck in snake venom; the bite of the viper will kill them.
018	JOB	020	017	They will not live to enjoy the streams, the rivers of milk and honey.
018	JOB	020	018	They will have to give back what they have gained and will not have any benefit; they will not enjoy any of their profits.
018	JOB	020	019	For they have oppressed and abandoned the poor; they have seized houses they did not build.
