018	JOB	021	029	Haven't you asked people who travel? Don't you pay attention to what they tell you?
018	JOB	021	030	Wicked people are spared in times of disaster; they are rescued from the day of judgment.
018	JOB	021	031	Who confronts them with their actions? Who pays them back for what they have done?
