018	JOB	021	033	Everyone attends their funeral service; a huge procession of people comes to pay their last respects.
018	JOB	021	034	Why do you try to comfort me with worthless nonsense? Your answers are just a pack of lies!”
018	JOB	022	001	Then Eliphaz the Temanite responded and said,
018	JOB	022	002	“How can anyone be of help to God? Even wise people are only helpful to themselves.
018	JOB	022	003	Is it any benefit to the Almighty if you're a good person? What does he gain if you do what's right?
