018	JOB	022	026	Then you will find delight in the Almighty, and be able to face him without feeling ashamed.
018	JOB	022	027	You will pray to him, and he will hear you, and you will keep your promises to him.
018	JOB	022	028	Whatever you decide to do will be successful, and wherever you go, light will shine on you.
018	JOB	022	029	When others are humbled, and you say, ‘please help them,’ God will save them.
018	JOB	022	030	God saves those who are innocent, and you will be saved if you do what is right.”
018	JOB	023	001	Job replied,
018	JOB	023	002	“Just the same, my complaints today remain bitter. In spite of my groaning he is still punishing me.
018	JOB	023	003	If only I knew where I could find him so I could go to where he sits in judgment.
