018	JOB	028	001	“There are silver mines and places where gold is refined.
018	JOB	028	002	Iron is extracted from the earth and copper is smelted from its ore.
018	JOB	028	003	Miners take lamps into the darkness underground and search for ore as far as they can go in the shadows and the gloom.
018	JOB	028	004	They dig a mineshaft far from where people live or anyone ever goes. They swing from ropes that hang in the pits.
