019	PSA	046	007	The Lord Almighty is with us; the God of Jacob protects us. (Selah)
019	PSA	046	008	Come and see what the Lord has achieved! See the amazing things he has done on the earth!
019	PSA	046	009	He stops wars all over the world. He smashes the bow; he breaks the spear; he sets shields on fire.
019	PSA	046	010	Stop fighting! Recognize I am God! I am the ruler of the nations; I am the ruler of the earth.
019	PSA	046	011	The Lord Almighty is with us; the God of Jacob protects us. (Selah)
019	PSA	047	001	For the music director. A psalm of the sons of Korah. Everyone, clap your hands! Shout with joy to the Lord!
019	PSA	047	002	For the Lord Most High is awe-inspiring; he is the great King of all the earth.
019	PSA	047	003	He subdues other peoples under us; he puts nations under our feet.
019	PSA	047	004	He chose the land for us to own; the proud possession of Jacob's descendants whom he loves. (Selah)
019	PSA	047	005	God ascends his throne with a great shout, the Lord is accompanied by the sound of the trumpet.
019	PSA	047	006	Sing praises to God, sing praises; sing praises to our King, sing praises!
019	PSA	047	007	For God is King of all the earth; sing praises with a psalm!
019	PSA	047	008	God rules over the nations; he sits on his holy throne.
019	PSA	047	009	The rulers of the nations gather together with the people of the God of Abraham, for the defenders of the earth belong to God. He is highly honored everywhere.
019	PSA	048	001	For the music director. A psalm of the sons of Korah. The Lord is supreme! He deserves praise in the city of our God on his holy mountain.
019	PSA	048	002	Mount Zion is high and beautiful, bringing happiness to all the earth; on the northern side is the city of the great King.
019	PSA	048	003	God himself is in the city's fortresses; he is recognized as its defender.
019	PSA	048	004	Look at what happened when foreign kings joined forces and came to attack the city.
