019	PSA	048	006	They shook all over, and were in agonizing pain like a woman giving birth,
019	PSA	048	007	just as the strong east wind wrecks the ships from Tarshish.
019	PSA	048	008	Just as we had heard, but now we have seen the city of the Lord Almighty. This is the city of our God; he makes it secure forever. (Selah)
019	PSA	048	009	God, we recall your trustworthy love as we worship in the Temple.
019	PSA	048	010	As is fitting for your reputation, God, praises to you stretch all around the world. What you do is always right!
019	PSA	048	011	Let the people of Mount Zion be glad; let the people of Judah celebrate because your judgments are always fair!
019	PSA	048	012	Go and take a look at Zion. Count the towers as you walk around.
