019	PSA	048	014	“This is who our God is. He is our God forever and ever. He himself will lead us until the very end.”
019	PSA	049	001	For the music director. A psalm of the sons of Korah. Listen to this, everyone! Pay attention, people of the world—
019	PSA	049	002	whether you are highborn or lowborn, rich or poor!
019	PSA	049	003	For what I say is wise, and my thinking is perceptive.
