019	PSA	049	014	Like sheep they are destined for the grave. Death will be their shepherd. Those who live right will rule over them in the morning. Their bodies will decay in the grave, far from their homes.
019	PSA	049	015	But surely God will rescue me from the power of the grave; he will grab me back. (Selah)
