019	PSA	050	019	With your mouth you say evil things; you use your tongue to spread lies.
019	PSA	050	020	You sit there and speak against your brother, slandering your own mother's son.
019	PSA	050	021	I kept quiet when you did these things. You thought I was someone just like you. But now I confront you, and bring my charges against you.
019	PSA	050	022	Think again, you people who dismiss God, or I will tear you apart, and no one will be able to save you.
