019	PSA	051	005	It's true that I was born guilty—sinful from the time my mother conceived me.
019	PSA	051	006	But you want truth on the inside; you teach me wisdom deep within.
019	PSA	051	007	Purify me with hyssop so I can be clean; wash me so I can be whiter than snow.
