019	PSA	104	033	I will sing to the Lord for as long as I live; I will sing praises to my God my whole life.
019	PSA	104	034	May he be pleased with my thoughts because I am happy in the Lord.
019	PSA	104	035	Let sinners be destroyed from the earth; let the wicked cease to exist. Let every part of me praise the Lord!
019	PSA	105	001	Give the Lord thanks, worship his wonderful nature, let people know what he's done!
