019	PSA	107	036	He brings hungry people to live there—a place they can build their cities.
019	PSA	107	037	They sow their fields and plant their vineyards, producing a good harvest.
019	PSA	107	038	He takes care of them, and their numbers increase dramatically—their cattle too!
