019	PSA	115	005	They have mouths, but can't speak. They have eyes, but can't see.
019	PSA	115	006	They have ears, but can't hear. They have noses, but can't smell.
019	PSA	115	007	They have hands, but can't feel. They have feet, but can't walk. No sound comes from their throats.
019	PSA	115	008	Those who make idols become just like them, and so does everyone who trusts in them.
019	PSA	115	009	Israel, trust in the Lord! He is the one who helps you and protects you.
019	PSA	115	010	Descendants of Aaron, trust in the Lord! He is the one who helps you and protects you.
019	PSA	115	011	Those who honor the Lord, trust in the Lord! He is the one who helps you and protects you.
019	PSA	115	012	The Lord keeps us in mind and will be good to us. He will bless Israel, he will bless the descendants of Aaron.
019	PSA	115	013	The Lord will bless all those who worship him, whoever they are.
019	PSA	115	014	May the Lord be good to you, you and your children.
