019	PSA	115	016	The heavens belong to the Lord, but he has given the earth to humankind.
019	PSA	115	017	The dead do not praise the Lord, those who have gone down into the silence of the grave.
019	PSA	115	018	But we the living will always praise the Lord. Praise the Lord!
019	PSA	116	001	I love the Lord because he listens to me, he hears my calls for help.
