019	PSA	119	115	Leave me alone, you evil people, and let me keep the commandments of my God.
019	PSA	119	116	Support me, Lord, as you promised, so I can live. Don't let my hope turn into discouragement.
019	PSA	119	117	Support me, so I can be saved and always pay attention to your instructions.
019	PSA	119	118	You reject all those who don't follow your instructions—they're fooling themselves by living a lie.
019	PSA	119	119	You treat the wicked people on earth as something worthless to be discarded; therefore I love your laws.
019	PSA	119	120	I have goose bumps thinking of you—I'm in awe! I'm scared of your judgments! Ayin
019	PSA	119	121	I have done what's fair and right, so please don't abandon me to my enemies.
019	PSA	119	122	Please promise you'll take care of me, your servant. Don't let these arrogant people mistreat me.
019	PSA	119	123	I strain my eyes looking for your salvation, watching for you to fulfill your promise to make everything good.
019	PSA	119	124	Please treat me, your servant, according to your trustworthy love. Teach me what you want me to do.
019	PSA	119	125	I am your servant. Please give me discernment so I can understand your instructions.
019	PSA	119	126	Lord, it's time for you to act, for these people have broken your laws.
019	PSA	119	127	This is why I love your commandments more than gold, more than the finest gold.
019	PSA	119	128	All of your rules are right in every way, and so I hate any way of life that's just a lie. Pe
019	PSA	119	129	Your laws are truly wonderful—that's why I keep them!
019	PSA	119	130	Studying your words brings light so that even the uneducated can understand.
019	PSA	119	131	With keen desire I long for what you have to say.
019	PSA	119	132	Please pay attention to me and be kind to me, as you are with those who love you.
019	PSA	119	133	Tell me by your word the way I should go, and don't let any kind of evil control me.
019	PSA	119	134	Save me from cruel people so I can follow your instructions.
019	PSA	119	135	Please look favorably on me, your servant, teach me what I should do.
019	PSA	119	136	My tears stream down as I weep for those who don't keep your law. Tsadhe
