019	PSA	119	138	You have given your instructions which are fair and totally trustworthy.
019	PSA	119	139	My devotion is burning me up inside because my enemies ignore your words.
019	PSA	119	140	Your promises have been proved true, and that's why I, your servant, love them.
019	PSA	119	141	I may be unimportant and looked down on, but I don't forget your commandments.
019	PSA	119	142	Your goodness and justice last forever; and your law is the truth.
019	PSA	119	143	When I have problems and sadness, your commands make me happy.
019	PSA	119	144	Your laws are always right; help me to understand what they mean so I can live. Qoph
