019	PSA	119	148	During the night I stay awake, meditating on your word.
019	PSA	119	149	Listen to what I have to say, Lord, because of your trustworthy love. Keep me alive, Lord, because you always do what's right.
019	PSA	119	150	Evil people come running to attack me—they totally disregard your law.
019	PSA	119	151	But you, Lord, are close beside me; all your commandments are true.
019	PSA	119	152	Long ago I realized that your laws will last forever. Resh
