019	PSA	134	001	A song for pilgrims going up to Jerusalem. Praise the Lord, all you servants of the Lord who worship at night in the house of the Lord.
019	PSA	134	002	Lift up your hands towards the holy place and praise the Lord.
019	PSA	134	003	May the Lord bless you from Zion, he who made the heavens and the earth.
019	PSA	135	001	Praise the Lord! Praise the Lord's reputation! Praise the Lord, all you servants of the Lord
