019	PSA	135	005	I know how great the Lord is—our Lord is greater than all gods.
019	PSA	135	006	The Lord does whatever he wants throughout heaven and earth, on the seas and in the ocean depths.
019	PSA	135	007	He causes the clouds to rise all over the earth, he makes lightning flash and give rain, he sends the winds from his storehouses.
019	PSA	135	008	He struck down the firstborn of Egypt, both human and animal.
