020	PRO	024	024	Those who tell the guilty, “You're innocent,” will be cursed by the people and hated by the nation,
020	PRO	024	025	while those who convict the guilty will be appreciated, and will receive a rich blessing.
020	PRO	024	026	An honest answer is a kiss on the lips.
