023	ISA	057	006	You have chosen to worship the smooth stones from the streams of the valleys—that's the choice you've made! You have poured out drink offerings to these idols—you have presented them with grain offerings. Should that make me happy?
023	ISA	057	007	You have committed adultery by idol worship on every high mountain; you went there to offer pagan sacrifices.
