024	JER	052	014	The whole Babylonian army under the commander of the guard knocked down all the walls around Jerusalem.
024	JER	052	015	Nebuzaradan, the commander of the guard, deported some of the poor people and those who were left in the city, even those who had gone over to the side of the king of Babylon, as well as the rest of the craftsmen.
