035	HAB	002	008	Because you have plundered many nations, those who are left will plunder you—for the human blood you have shed and the destruction you brought on lands and cities, and those who lived there.
035	HAB	002	009	What disaster is coming to you who build houses through dishonest gain! You think you can place your “nest” so high it will be safe from disaster.
035	HAB	002	010	Your evil schemes have brought shame upon your families, by destroying many nations you have forfeited your own lives.
035	HAB	002	011	Even the stones in the wall cry out in condemnation, and the wooden rafters join in too.
035	HAB	002	012	What disaster is coming to you who build cities with bloodshed, who found cities built on wickedness!
035	HAB	002	013	Hasn't the Lord Almighty decided that all the hard work of such nations is going to be burned up—that they wear themselves out for nothing?
035	HAB	002	014	For the earth will be filled with the knowledge of the Lord's glory as the waters fill the sea.
