036	ZEP	001	016	a day of trumpet calls and battle cries against fortified cities and watchtowers.
036	ZEP	001	017	I will bring trouble on humanity, making them walk like blind people because they have sinned against the Lord. Their blood will be spilled like so much dust; their intestines like dung.
036	ZEP	001	018	Their silver and their gold won't help to save them on the day of the Lord's anger. The whole earth will be burned up by the fire of his jealous anger. He will make sure the end of the people of the world is sudden and complete.
