036	ZEP	003	008	You just wait, declares the Lord. The day is coming when I will rise to give evidence. For I have decided to gather together all the nations and kingdoms and to pour out on them my anger, my fury and my rage. The whole earth will be burned up by the fire of my jealous anger.
036	ZEP	003	009	For then I will give the nations pure speech so they can all pray and worship the Lord together.
036	ZEP	003	010	From beyond the rivers of Ethiopia my scattered people, my worshipers, will come to bring their offerings to me.
