036	ZEP	003	017	The Lord your God is among you as a mighty warrior who saves. He will be so happy with you. He will renew his love for you. He will celebrate over you with loud singing.
036	ZEP	003	018	I will gather those of you who mourn for the religious festivals—you will no longer have to bear the disgrace.
036	ZEP	003	019	Look at what I am going to do! At that time I am going to deal with all those who have oppressed you. I will save those who are helpless and bring back those who were scattered, and I will turn their shame into praise, and all the world will respect them.
