040	MAT	004	018	As he was walking by the Sea of Galilee Jesus saw two brothers. Simon, also called Peter, and his brother Andrew, were casting a net in the sea. They made their living by catching fish.
040	MAT	004	019	“Come and follow me, and I will teach you how to catch people,” he told them.
