041	MAR	015	033	At noon darkness fell over the whole land until three in the afternoon.
041	MAR	015	034	At three o'clock Jesus cried out, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani,” which means, “My God, my God, why have you abandoned me?”
041	MAR	015	035	Some of those standing there heard this, and said, “He's calling for Elijah.”
