044	ACT	002	026	That's why I'm so happy! That's why my words are full of joy! That's why my body lives in hope!
044	ACT	002	027	For you will not abandon me in the grave, nor will you allow your Holy One to experience decay.
044	ACT	002	028	You have revealed to me the ways of life. You will fill me with joy with your presence.’
044	ACT	002	029	My brothers and sisters, let me tell you plainly that our ancestor David died and was buried, and his tomb is here with us to this day.
