044	ACT	002	037	When the people heard this they were conscience-stricken. They asked Peter and the other apostles, “Brothers, what should we do?”
044	ACT	002	038	“Repent!” Peter told them. “All of you must be baptized in the name of Jesus Christ for the forgiveness of your sins, and you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit.
044	ACT	002	039	This promise is given to you, to your children, and to all who are far away—everyone the Lord our God calls.”
