047	2CO	005	011	Knowing how we are in awe of the Lord, we try to convince others. It's clear to God what we are, and I hope that it's clear to your minds too.
047	2CO	005	012	We are not trying to speak well of ourselves again, just trying to give you the opportunity to be proud of us, so you can answer those who are proud of outward show and not what they are inside.
047	2CO	005	013	If we are “crazy people,” it's for God. If we make good sense, it's for you.
