047	2CO	005	016	From now on we don't look at anyone from a human point of view. Even though we once viewed Christ this way, we don't do so any longer.
047	2CO	005	017	That's why anyone who is in Christ is a new being—what was old is gone, the new has come!
047	2CO	005	018	God did all this by changing us from enemies into friends through Christ. God gave us this same work of changing his enemies into his friends.
047	2CO	005	019	For God was in Christ, bringing the world back from hostility to friendship with him, not counting anyone's sins against them, and giving us this message to change his enemies into his friends.
