047	2CO	007	001	Dear friends, since we have these promises, we should wash ourselves clean from all that makes both body and spirit dirty, aiming for complete holiness out of reverence for God.
047	2CO	007	002	Please accept us as your friends! We haven't done anyone wrong, we haven't corrupted anyone, and we haven't taken advantage of anyone.
047	2CO	007	003	I'm not saying this to condemn you—as I already told you, you mean so much to us that we live and die together with you!
047	2CO	007	004	I speak up very strongly for you because I am so proud of you. You are such an encouragement to me. I am so happy for you despite all our troubles.
047	2CO	007	005	When we arrived in Macedonia we didn't have a minute's peace. We were attacked from every direction, with external conflicts and inner fears.
047	2CO	007	006	Even so, God who encourages the downhearted, encouraged us with Titus' arrival.
